# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Linter cache. ruff writes its own .gitignore inside, so this is belt and braces -
# but MAINTAINING.md tells you to run `ruff check .` locally, so everyone grows this
# directory, and whether it stays out of `git status` should not rest on what a
# third-party tool happens to do.
.ruff_cache/

# Everything the build caches: the card database, cached deck pages, the learned
# request rate - and the Cloudflare clearance cookie, which is a live credential
# tied to this machine. Do not narrow this to one file; a committed cf_clearance
# is a secret in history, and git history is hard to scrub.
.cache/

# Scratch
.scratch/

# Generated single-file report (tools/bundle_report.py). Regenerate it; don't commit
# it - and if the data came from somewhere you may not redistribute, keep it local.
/report.html

# The generated report data. Deliberately NOT tracked.
#
# It is build output, and after any inkdecks build it holds data licensed for private
# use only. Tracking it means the next build shows up as a modified file that is easy
# to commit without thinking - and once it is in history, making this repo public
# later republishes it retroactively. Git history is hard to scrub.
#
# Regenerate in seconds:  python tools/generate_sample_decks.py
site/data/meta.json

# Decklists under data/decks/ - both kinds, neither of which belongs in history.
#
# The synthetic sample field is generated and its dates are relative to "today", so
# it shows up as modified every day and after every build - 110 KB of pure noise in
# `git status`. Nothing depends on a committed copy: CI regenerates it, and so does
# the documented first command.
#
# Your own lists are the other kind: local events, lists copied by hand. They are
# yours, they may not be yours to redistribute, and the same retroactive-publication
# problem as site/data/meta.json applies to them.
#
# Regenerate the sample:   python tools/generate_sample_decks.py
# Commit one on purpose:   git add -f data/decks/whatever.json
data/decks/*
!data/decks/README.md
